{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01E3rJq32kRyPect8mGFokUS","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tRead TASK.md in this folder: it describes a game to build. Don't build it yet: plan it. Write PLAN.md in this folder for the developers who will build it from TASK.md and your plan; they may be other AI models, working without you. Start PLAN.md with the game's title, picked as TASK.md says. Cover the architecture and modules, every system and mechanic TASK.md asks for, the content (levels, enemies, items, story beats), the order to build in with milestones, the riskiest parts and how to de-risk them, and how to test each part. Be specific enough that a capable developer can build the whole demo from TASK.md and PLAN.md alone. Then reply with a short summary of the plan.\n2\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"10fd43c2-a819-4540-9aa0-cc285e3b03f8","uuid":"15bcd1ae-ce27-4d5c-9c7f-0c9368da6e2b","timestamp":"2026-11-04T00:48:34.583Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174825__x17a627/work/STAGE.md","content":"Read TASK.md in this folder: it describes a game to build. Don't build it yet: plan it. Write PLAN.md in this folder for the developers who will build it from TASK.md and your plan; they may be other AI models, working without you. Start PLAN.md with the game's title, picked as TASK.md says. Cover the architecture and modules, every system and mechanic TASK.md asks for, the content (levels, enemies, items, story beats), the order to build in with milestones, the riskiest parts and how to de-risk them, and how to test each part. Be specific enough that a capable developer can build the whole demo from TASK.md and PLAN.md alone. Then reply with a short summary of the plan.\n","numLines":2,"startLine":1,"totalLines":2}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01E3rJq32kRyPect8mGFokUS","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
